    dzdoc:hasDefinitionOccurrence <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1971-04-22/71-28#art_258_defocc_8f7b6b077eb8>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1971-04-22/71-28#art_259_defocc_cc5a40d199ee>,
