        <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1971-04-22/71-28#art_105_para_1>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1971-04-22/71-28#art_105_para_2>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1971-04-22/71-28#art_105_para_3>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/order/1971-04-22/71-28#art_105_para_4>,
